# "The first non-Lemur creature spell with flying you cast" asks of an earlier spell what it was as it became cast
# (CR 601.2i), not what an effect made it on the stack afterwards nor what it was as it left. Bot1's second Momo, a Lemur Bat
# Ally, is cast a Lemur; in response Artificial Evolution makes it a Bird Bat Ally (CR 612.1: the type line's creature type),
# and it resolves a Bird. It was still no non-Lemur spell as cast, so Faerie Mastermind, cast next with Mox Sapphire alone,
# is the first and costs {U}. The legend rule keeps the first Momo, whose words still say Lemur.

